Meta.documentation:Content-Type.image.jpeg
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The image/jpeg subtype. Bytes in through the octetstream interface
Meta.documentation:(the family's shared streaming contract — a future streaming
Meta.documentation:transport lands here once for every subtype), bytes out on
Meta.documentation:out_octetstream; out_jpeg emits the jpeg resource itself so the
Meta.documentation:mime travels with the value. go fires the most specific
Meta.documentation:connected output.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_octetstream_$all — the image bytes
Meta.documentation:@port out_octetstream — the bytes, fired on in_go
Meta.documentation:@port out_jpeg — this resource, self-typed, fired on in_go
